[sop_dart_06] Dart - SOP: Langkah 4: Pengujian Fitur Modern Dart 3 (Records & Patterns)
Dokumen: Standar Operasional Prosedur (SOP): Setup dan Konfigurasi Lingkungan Pemrograman Dart (Dart 3.x & Pub)
Kategori: SOP Setup & Environment
Sumber: knowledge-base/sop-setup-environment-dart.md

1. Buka berkas `bin/my_dart_project.dart` dan perbarui kode pengujian:
   ```dart
   // Uji Dart 3 Records dengan positional & named parameters
   (String, {int code, bool active}) getSystemStatus() {
     return ("Lingkungan Dart 3.x terverifikasi", code: 200, active: true);
   }

   void main() {
     // Uji Dart 3 Pattern Matching & Destructuring
     var (message, code: statusCode, active: isRunning) = getSystemStatus();

     print('Pesan: $message');
     print('Kode Respon: $statusCode (Aktif: $isRunning)');

     // Uji switch expression dengan pattern matching
     var label = switch (statusCode) {
       200 => "Status: Sukses dan siap digunakan.",
       _ => "Status: Terjadi kesalahan."
     };
     print(label);
   }
   ```
2. Jalankan aplikasi via Dart runtime:
   ```bash
   dart run
   ```
3. Uji kompilasi ke biner mandiri AOT (*Ahead-of-Time*):
   ```bash
   dart compile exe bin/my_dart_project.dart -o app_dart
   ./app_dart
   ```

[sop_javascript_07] JavaScript - SOP: Langkah 5: Pengujian Eksekusi Kode JavaScript Modern (ES2023/ES2024)
Dokumen: Standar Operasional Prosedur (SOP): Setup dan Standarisasi Lingkungan JavaScript (Node.js 20/22 LTS & Modern ESM)
Kategori: SOP Setup & Environment
Sumber: knowledge-base/sop-setup-environment-javascript.md

1. Buat berkas uji `index.js`:
   ```javascript
   // Menguji fitur ES2023/ES2024: Object.groupBy dan Array.toSorted()
   const items = [
     { name: "Node.js", category: "Runtime", year: 2009 },
     { name: "FastAPI", category: "Backend", year: 2018 },
     { name: "Ollama", category: "AI", year: 2023 }
   ];

   const sortedItems = items.toSorted((a, b) => a.year - b.year);
   const grouped = Object.groupBy(sortedItems, item => item.category);

