the
dispatch receiver. The extension function's receiver type is the `Host` class, so the `Host` class is the extension
receiver.
If the dispatch receiver and the extension receiver have members with the same name, the extension receiver's
member takes
precedence. To access the dispatch receiver explicitly, use the qualified `this` syntax:
